    "answer": {
      "short": "$2 \\times 10^{-8}\\text{ g}$; divide $0.05\\text{ g}$ by $2.5 \\times 10^6$.",
      "worked": "$$50\\text{ mg} = 0.05\\text{ g}$$\n$$\\begin{align*}\\text{Mass of one microbe} &\\approx \\frac{0.05}{2.5 \\times 10^6}\\text{ g}\\\\&= 2 \\times 10^{-8}\\text{ g}\\end{align*}$$",
